]"], "text": "The sample and the projection describe the same exposure.", "t0": 19.87, "t1": 22.53, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The same exposure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.49, 0.59, 0.7, 1.21, 1.67, 1.8, 2.07]}, {"scene": "sample", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Authority described a backlog after pandemic waivers.", "t0": 22.65, "t1": 25.63, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy22", "kicker": "Federal Audit Clearinghouse / independent auditor", "text": "Earlier inspection finding", "mark": "Earlier inspection finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.59, 1.08, 1.17, 1.72, 1.97, 2.53]}, {"scene": "follow", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Five inspections were late in the next sample of sixty. In the following year, seven were late.", "t0": 25.85, "t1": 31.22, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Inspection timing", "heading": "Later samples of 60 tenants", "source": "fy25", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "FY2024 late inspections", "value": "5"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "FY2025 late inspections", "value": "7"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.89, 1.08, 1.3, 1.39, 1.51, 1.74, 2.1, 2.19, 3.25, 3.43, 3.54, 3.99, 4.59, 4.96, 5.14]}, {"scene": "follow", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In both later samples the units were eventually inspected and found compliant.", "t0": 31.34, "t1": 35.49, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy24", "kicker": "Federal Audit Clearinghouse / independent auditor", "text": "FY2024 and FY2025", "mark": "FY2024 and FY2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.48, 0.77, 1.23, 1.43, 1.73, 1.88, 2.36, 3.0, 3.24, 3.53]}, {"scene": "follow", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Auditors questioned no costs for the later inspection timing findings.", "t0": 35.61, "t1": 39.01, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy25", "kicker": 